            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">Scale Up</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-1">Multi-Channel Pro</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Comprehensive omni-channel acquisition for scaling D2C & service companies.</p>
            <div class="mt-6 flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white font-display">₹29,999</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400 text-xs">/ month</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">+ Applicable GST / Ad Spend Extra</p>
            
            <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
