  <div id="privacyModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl max-w-2xl w-full max-h-[85vh] flex flex-col shadow-2xl">
      <div class="p-6 border-b border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Privacy Policy</h3>
        <button onclick="closeModal('privacyModal')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 overflow-y-auto space-y-4 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> January 1, 2026</p>
        <p>Welcome to RajaAdMedia (<a href="https://rajaadmedia.com" class="text-blue-400">rajaadmedia.com</a>). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting personal information provided by clients and website visitors.</p>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">1. Information We Collect</h4>
        <p>We may collect contact information (name, business email, phone number, company name), billing records, and technical analytics data when you fill out consultation forms or contract our services.</p>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">2. Use of Information</h4>
        <p>The information collected is used solely to execute digital advertising campaigns, issue formal tax invoices, communicate project progress, and comply with legal requirements under Indian law.</p>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">3. Information Sharing</h4>
        <p>We do not sell, rent, or lease client lists to third parties. Data is only shared with trusted payment gateways (such as Razorpay) to complete secure transactions.</p>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">4. Data Security</h4>
        <p>We employ 256-bit SSL encryption and strict administrative safeguards to prevent unauthorized access or disclosure of your information.</p>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">5. Contact Grievance</h4>
        <p>For inquiries regarding this policy, reach out to our grievance desk at <span class="text-blue-400">support@rajaadmedia.com</span> or Ward No 09, Sugar Mill Laksar Colony, Laksar, Haridwar, Uttarakhand 247663.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-right">
        <button onclick="closeModal('privacyModal')" class="px-5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold">Close</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- MODAL: Terms and Conditions -->
  <div id="termsModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl max-w-2xl w-full max-h-[85vh] flex flex-col shadow-2xl">
      <div class="p-6 border-b border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Terms and Conditions</h3>
        <button onclick="closeModal('termsModal')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 overflow-y-auto space-y-4 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p>These Terms and Conditions govern the use of marketing and media services offered by <strong>RajaAdMedia</strong> (Proprietor: Raja Kumar).</p>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">1. Scope of Services</h4>
        <p>RajaAdMedia provides professional digital advertising management, creative asset production, and marketing consultation. Direct ad spend on advertising platforms (Meta, Google, etc.) is paid directly by the client to the respective platforms unless explicitly agreed in a customized written invoice.</p>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">2. Invoicing & Payments</h4>
        <p>Service retainers are billed in advance on a monthly or milestone basis in INR (₹). Payments must be settled via authorized banking channels or Razorpay.</p>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">3. Intellectual Property</h4>
        <p>All ad creatives, copy assets, and dashboards prepared specifically for the client become the property of the client upon receipt of full service payment.</p>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">4. Governing Law & Jurisdiction</h4>
        <p>These terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India. Any disputes arising shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts in Haridwar, Uttarakhand.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-right">
        <button onclick="closeModal('termsModal')" class="px-5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold">Close</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- MODAL: Cancellation and Refund Policy -->
  <div id="refundModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl max-w-2xl w-full max-h-[85vh] flex flex-col shadow-2xl">
      <div class="p-6 border-b border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Cancellation & Refund Policy</h3>
        <button onclick="closeModal('refundModal')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 overflow-y-auto space-y-4 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">1. Cancellation Policy</h4>
        <p>Clients may cancel their ongoing monthly retainer by providing at least 7 business days written notice prior to the beginning of the next billing cycle by emailing <span class="text-blue-400">support@rajaadmedia.com</span>. Once the cancellation is confirmed, no renewal charges will apply.</p>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">2. Refund Eligibility</h4>
        <p>Because digital marketing and advertising management involve immediate allocation of media resources, research hours, and creative development:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Pre-Campaign Work:</strong> If a cancellation is requested within 24 hours of retainer payment before any onboarding or creative work has commenced, a 100% refund will be issued.</li>
          <li><strong>Ongoing Services:</strong> Once campaign setup, creative designing, or audience research has commenced, retainer fees are non-refundable for that active billing cycle.</li>
        </ul>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">3. Refund Processing Window</h4>
        <p>Approved refunds are processed via the original payment method within 5 to 7 working days via our banking partner/Razorpay.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-right">
        <button onclick="closeModal('refundModal')" class="px-5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold">Close</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- MODAL: Service Delivery Policy -->
  <div id="shippingModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl max-w-2xl w-full max-h-[85vh] flex flex-col shadow-2xl">
      <div class="p-6 border-b border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Service Delivery & Fulfillment Policy</h3>
        <button onclick="closeModal('shippingModal')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 overflow-y-auto space-y-4 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p>RajaAdMedia delivers intangible digital marketing, advertising setup, and consulting services. No physical goods or packages are shipped.</p>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Fulfillment Timelines:</h4>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li><strong>Onboarding & Access Setup:</strong> Within 24-48 business hours after invoice clearance.</li>
          <li><strong>Campaign Auditing & Strategy:</strong> Delivered via email and video conference within 3 business days.</li>
          <li><strong>Live Campaign Deployment:</strong> Within 3 to 5 business days following client creative approval.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>All reports, creative deliverables, and analytics are provided digitally via secure cloud drives and official client emails.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-right">
        <button onclick="closeModal('shippingModal')" class="px-5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold">Close</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- MODAL: Interactive Checkout / Order Preview -->
  <div id="checkoutModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl max-w-md w-full p-6 shadow-2xl">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-4 mb-4">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-bag-shopping text-blue-400"></i>
          Service Order Summary
        </h3>
        <button onclick="closeModal('checkoutModal')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i></button>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-3 text-xs">
        <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-400">
          <span>Service Plan:</span>
          <span id="planName" class="text-white font-semibold">--</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-400">
          <span>Billing Period:</span>
          <span class="text-white">Monthly Retainer</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-400">
          <span>Base Fee:</span>
          <span id="planPrice" class="text-white font-mono font-bold text-sm">--</span>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-3 flex justify-between text-white font-bold text-sm">
          <span>Total Payable:</span>
          <span id="planTotal" class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-base">--</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 text-[11px] text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-2">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-emerald-400 text-base"></i>
        <span>Bank transfer / Razorpay invoice link will be dispatched to your email.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 flex gap-3">
        <button onclick="closeModal('checkoutModal')" class="w-1/2 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold">Cancel</button>
        <a href="#contact" onclick="closeModal('checkoutModal')" class="w-1/2 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white text-xs font-semibold text-center flex items-center justify-center">Proceed to Inquiry</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Mobile navigation toggle
    const mobileBtn = document.getElementById('mobileMenuBtn');
    const mobileMenu = document.getElementById('mobileMenu');
    mobileBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      mobileMenu.classList.toggle('hidden');
    });

    // Close mobile menu on click
    mobileMenu.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(link => {
      link.addEventListener('click', () => mobileMenu.classList.add('hidden'));
    });

    // Modal controls
    function openModal(modalId) {
      document.getElementById(modalId).classList.remove('hidden');
      document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
    }

    function closeModal(modalId) {
      document.getElementById(modalId).classList.add('hidden');
      document.body.style.overflow = 'auto';
    }

    // Checkout modal helper
    function openCheckout(name, price) {
      document.getElementById('planName').textContent = name;
      document.getElementById('planPrice').textContent = '₹' + Number(price).toLocaleString('en-IN');
      document.getElementById('planTotal').textContent = '₹' + Number(price).toLocaleString('en-IN');
      openModal('checkoutModal');
    }

    // Contact form mockup submit
    function handleFormSubmit(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      const successBox = document.getElementById('formSuccess');
      successBox.classList.remove('hidden');
      e.target.reset();
      setTimeout(() => {
        successBox.classList.add('hidden');
      }, 6000);
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
